        <title type="html"><![CDATA[FF140 MutationEvent remove]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27010</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27010"/>
        <updated>2025-06-09T00:47:16.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF140 removes the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/MutationEvent" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">MutationEvent</code></a> and associated events such as <code class="notranslate">DOMAttrModified</code>, <code class="notranslate">DOMCharacterDataModified</code> ... in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1963043" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1963043</a><br>
(These are behind a pref that is now false).</p>
<p dir="auto">This marks the API as removed. The events do not appear to have any BCD entries so no changes there.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3124363972" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39825" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/39825/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39825">mdn/content#39825</a></p>]]></content>
